{"id":3878,"title":{"romaji":"Uchi no Shishou wa Shippo ga Nai","english":"My Master Has No Tail","native":"うちの師匠はしっぽがない"},"slug":"uchi_no_shishou_wa_shippo_ga_nai","synopsis":"Throughout time, supernatural, shapeshifting tanuki loved playing tricks on humankind. One plucky tanuki, Mameda, is no different. But there's one big problem. She wasn’t born in the days of yore — she was born in modern, more cynical times! How can she fulfill her mischievous tanuki destiny when supernatural hijinks are a thing of the past? She finds an angle when she meets Bunko, a master of the Japanese art of rakugo, which uses storytelling to beguile its audience. Mameda is determined to use rakugo to cast a spell on humanity, but first this tanuki trickster must convince the no-nonsense Bunko to take her on as an apprentice.","format":"TV","season":"FALL","year":2022,"createdAt":"2022-09-22 22:37:24","updatedAt":"2022-09-22 22:37:24","resources":{"nodes":[{"site":"MAL","externalId":49533},{"site":"KITSU","externalId":44954},{"site":"ANILIST","externalId":137341},{"site":"ANIDB","externalId":16512},{"site":"ANN","externalId":24601},{"site":"ANIME_PLANET","externalId":17497},{"site":"X","externalId":null},{"site":"OFFICIAL_SITE","externalId":null},{"site":"HIDIVE","externalId":null}]},"images":{"nodes":[{"id":9975,"facet":"LARGE_COVER","path":"anime/large-cover/zgs4aXkhXVdiAMgMXtzjaI1FCDVuJsfVgR9b7rbe.jpg"},{"id":9976,"facet":"SMALL_COVER","path":"anime/small-cover/ltFfouUicfcctDuJ8Hh4A0rgFOtF8cdbRB8uf7tj.avif"}]},"studios":{"nodes":[{"id":41,"name":"LIDENFILMS","slug":"lidenfilms"}]},"series":{"nodes":[]},"animethemes":[{"id":11765,"slug":"OP1","type":"OP","sequence":null,"song":{"id":11762,"title":{"romaji":"Genai Yuugi","native":null}},"animethemeentries":[{"id":13688,"version":1,"episodes":"1-13","nsfw":false,"spoiler":false,"videos":{"nodes":[{"id":15982,"basename":"ShippoNa-OP1.webm","filename":"ShippoNa-OP1","link":"https://v.animethemes.moe/ShippoNa-OP1.webm","mimetype":"video/web